'''Mesocosmocyclone''' (ミニスターサイクロン, ''Mini Sutā Saikuron'', '''Mini Star Cyclone''') is a [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred]] [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]] and variant of [[Super Cosmic Cyclone]] found in [[Cats of the Cosmos]] and [[Legend Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 8.3 Update|Version 8.3]].

