==Trivia==
*One of Mesocosmocyclone's parents can be assumed to be [[Super Cosmic Cyclone]], for obvious reasons.
*It has the shortest range of all [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien Enemies]].
*It and the [[Gardeneel Bros.]] are the only enemies that warp Cats forward.
*Its negative warp enables it to teleport cats behind the enemy base under rare circumstances. [https://youtu.be/N_G5hryrIG8 When this happens], the Cats will continue to walk forward until they go off-screen, disappearing from the [[Battle|battle]] but still counting towards the Cat Deploy Limit.
*It, [[Aku Cyclone]], [[Mini Angel Cyclone]] and [[Divine Cyclone]] are the only non-[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] Cyclones that don't destroy the ground when moving.
*Ironically, Mesocosmocyclone deals more damage than Super Cosmic Cyclone, its bigger counterpart.
*Its English description has a minor typo; double spaces in between "the" and "secret".
*Despite being claimed to have low stamina, it's typically fought with extremely high health for a peon due to buffs, exceeding 500,000 in [[Uncanny Legends]].
*Its damage is 666, which is commonly known as the [[wikipedia:Number of the Beast|Number of the Beast]].

